<header><p class="st-kicker">chiefdom · France and the Low Countries</p><h1 class="st-title">Boii of Gaul</h1><p class="st-meta">58 BCE – 51 BCE (approx.) · capital Gorgobina</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">Band of Boii who joined the Helvetian migration of 58 BCE and were resettled by Caesar in Aeduan territory.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>The <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/boii">Boii</a> were a widespread Celtic people known in <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/kingdom-of-bohemia">Bohemia</a>, which takes its name from them, and in northern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italy">Italy</a>. Caesar records that thirty-two thousand Boii joined the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/helvetii">Helvetii</a> in 58 BCE after besieging <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/noreia">Noreia</a> in <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/kingdom-of-noricum">Noricum</a>.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>After the defeat of the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/helvetii">Helvetii</a> near <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bibracte">Bibracte</a>, the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/aedui">Aedui</a> asked Caesar to let the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/boii">Boii</a> settle in their land because of their courage. They received the town of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gorgobina">Gorgobina</a>, perhaps near Saint-Parize-le-Châtel.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>In 52 BCE <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vercingetorix">Vercingetorix</a> besieged <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gorgobina">Gorgobina</a> to punish them for their loyalty to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rome">Rome</a>, and Caesar marched to their relief. They later vanish as a separate group within the Aeduan civitas.</p><p class="st-conf">Few sources survive for this state; details are uncertain.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><div class="st-emblem" role="img" aria-label="chiefdom, 58 BCE – 51 BCE (approx.)"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="44" cy="56" rx="16" ry="24"/><path d="M44 34 V78"/><path d="M68 20 V84"/><path d="M68 20 L63 30 H73 Z"/></svg><p class="st-emblem-type">chiefdom</p><p class="st-emblem-region">France and the Low Countries</p><div class="st-span" aria-hidden="true"><span class="st-span-bar" style="left:58.55%;width:1.20%"></span></div><div class="st-span-axis" aria-hidden="true"><span>3000 BCE</span><span>1 CE</span><span>2000</span></div></div><dl class="st-facts"><dt>Years</dt><dd>58 BCE – 51 BCE (approx.)</dd><dt>Century</dt><dd><a href="/centuries/1st-century-bce">1st century BCE</a></dd><dt>Type</dt><dd>chiefdom</dd><dt>Character</dt><dd>tribal</dd><dt>Capital</dt><dd>Gorgobina</dd><dt>Religion</dt><dd>Celtic polytheism</dd><dt>Language</dt><dd>Gaulish</dd><dt>Today</dt><dd><a href="/countries/france">France</a></dd><dt>Also</dt><dd>Boii (Gaul)</dd></dl><figure class="st-locator"><a href="/atlas?year=-54&amp;focus=boii-of-gaul" aria-label="Boii of Gaul on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="4725 543 640 512" role="img" aria-label="Map: where Boii of Gaul lay"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-n" d="M5095 786h0"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5045 799h0"/><path class="map-dot-ap" d="M5045 799h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>Location approximate: shown in present-day France. <a href="/atlas?year=-54&amp;focus=boii-of-gaul">On the atlas &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></aside></div>

